  unitName: Lunar Queen Alicia
  unitId: 50464
  unitNumber: 1293
  description: In prison, Alicia was visited by a Federation official, who requested
    for her to join the Ishgria Expeditionary Force in exchange for a pardon. Knowing
    that the demons had been sealed in Ishgria by Lucius, she agreed to assist the
    expedition. With experience teaching and motivating people from all walks of
    life, the former priestess quickly earned the squad's trust, and even the captain
    came to count upon her remarkable intellect. However, when the squad entered
    Ishgria and encountered the demons, she changed.
  summonDesc: Our Lord Lucius would only banish those of irredeemable evil. The defilers
    deserve only wrath!
  fusionDesc: Thanks be to our divine Summoner.<br>I, too, shall do my part to create
    your heaven on this earth.
  evoDesc: I am blessed with new strength. This is all the work of our divine Summoner.
    No, the providence of our god!
